  "description": "After discovering he's an omega, Yoontae runs away when his mother tries to pimp him out. A seemingly kind man offers him food and shelter—then abuses him. With nowhere else to go, Yoontae ends up in the very life he tried to escape, trading sex for survival. He convinces himself love can be bought or borrowed, until an abusive relationship leaves him broken once more. When his ex attacks him in public, a stranger named Wooseok steps in. Is this the start of something real—or just another trap? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
